---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { useTranslations } from "../../i18n/ui";

const lang = "en" as const;
const t = useTranslations(lang);
---

<Layout lang={lang} title={`Privacy Policy — ${t("site.name")}`} description="Kindcipe privacy policy.">
  <section class="section container">
    <article class="legal"> <h1>Privacy Policy</h1> <p class="meta">Effective 13 September 2026</p> <p>Kindcipe respects your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, store and protect your personal data.</p> <h2>1. Data we collect</h2> <ul> <li><strong>Account</strong>: email, display name, and basic profile from Google/Apple sign-in.</li> <li><strong>Household</strong>: kitchen/household name, members and roles.</li> <li><strong>Content</strong>: recipes, meal plans, shopping lists, purchase history and saved ingredients you enter, import or generate.</li> <li><strong>Device</strong>: crash logs (Sentry) and notification permission state.</li> <li><strong>Photos/Camera</strong>: only when you choose to upload a recipe screenshot (with your permission).</li> </ul> <h2>2. How we use it</h2> <ul> <li>To provide and improve app features (recipes, AI meals, meal planning, shopping lists, price comparison).</li> <li>To process subscriptions and payments (via App Store / Google Play in-app purchase; we never store your card details).</li> <li>To send reminders you have opted into.</li> <li>For debugging, security and abuse prevention.</li> </ul> <h2>3. AI-generated content</h2> <p>When you use AI meal generation, your preferences and ingredients are sent to our AI provider (Alibaba Cloud Model Studio DashScope/Qwen) solely to generate that result.</p> <h2>4. Third parties</h2> <ul> <li><strong>Sentry</strong> — crash reporting (no recipe content).</li> <li><strong>PostHog</strong> — anonymous product analytics (no recipe content).</li> <li><strong>Google / Apple sign-in</strong> — account authentication.</li> <li><strong>App Store / Google Play</strong> — subscription payments.</li> <li><strong>Alibaba Cloud DashScope</strong> — AI recipe generation.</li> </ul> <h2>5. Retention</h2> <p>Your account and content are kept until you delete your account. Logging out does not delete your data.</p> <h2>6. Deleting your account</h2> <p>In the app: Settings → Delete Account. This permanently removes your account and all related data and cannot be undone.</p> <h2>7. Children</h2> <p>The app is intended for family use but does not knowingly collect data from children under 13. Contact us to remove such data.</p> <h2>8. Security</h2> <p>We use reasonable measures including HTTPS and secure storage. No internet transmission is ever fully secure.</p> <h2>9. Your rights</h2> <p>You can view, correct or delete your data in the app at any time, or contact us to export or delete it.</p> <h2>10. Contact</h2> <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:support@kindcipe.com">support@kindcipe.com</a>.</p> <p class="meta">This policy may be updated; we will notify you in-app of significant changes.</p> </article>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .legal h1 { color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .legal .meta { color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: .85rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .legal h2 { color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 1.75rem 0 .75rem; }
  .legal p { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--color-text); }
  .legal ul { margin: 0 0 1rem 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; }
  .legal li { color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
</style>
